# HOSSPI HMS — Monorepo Rules Index

Purpose: single entry point for all Cursor rules in this repository.

## Product

**HOSSPI HMS** (HOSSPI Hospital Management System) is a full-stack, multi-tenant hospital management system:
- `frontend/` — Flutter client (`hosspi_hms`)
- `backend/` — Express.js API (`hms-backend`)
- Product scope and modules: [`app-write-up.mdc`](./app-write-up.mdc)

## Conflict order

When rules disagree, apply this order:

1. Security, privacy, safety, and compliance
2. [`.cursor/api-contract.mdc`](./api-contract.mdc) for cross-stack HTTP, errors, pagination, and naming
3. Product scope in [`app-write-up.mdc`](./app-write-up.mdc)
4. Contextual flow files (`flows/opd-flow.mdc`, `flows/ipd-flow.mdc`, `flows/icu-flow.mdc`) when editing those domains
5. Stack owner index: [`frontend/.cursor/index.mdc`](../frontend/.cursor/index.mdc) or [`backend/.cursor/index.mdc`](../backend/.cursor/index.mdc)
6. Other stack-specific rule files named in the stack index
7. `dev-plan/` steps (chronology only — not a duplicate standards source)

